// wdoc standard library — public entry point.
//
// A wdoc document opts into the schema with a single `import <wdoc.wcl>`
// line at the top. This file pulls in the prelude, which in turn imports
// every part of the library. The parts are embedded in the binary and
// resolved through the registry (see `crates/wcl_wdoc/src/build.rs`); the
// angle-bracket path is importer-relative within the `<wcl-system>`
// namespace, so `import <wdoc/prelude.wcl>` here resolves to that key.

namespace wdoc

import <wdoc/prelude.wcl>
